<title>USA: Henkel says to talk with Loctite.</title>
<headline>Henkel says to talk with Loctite.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany's Henkel KGaA said it intends to begin discussion's with Loctite Corp regarding Henkel's proposal to acquire the 65 percent of Loctite it does not already own &quot;in the area of $56 per share.&quot;</p>
<p>In a statement issued out of New York, Henkel also said it would prefer not to commnence a tender offer for the shares while talks are underway.</p>
<p>A spokesman for Hartford-based Loctite was not immediately available to comment.</p>
